<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - American Water a buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - American Water a buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- HSBC Washington Analysis said it initiated coverge of American Water Works Co Inc with a buy recommendation.</p>
<p>-- The company is the &quot;largest investor-owned water utility in the United States with 22 utility subsidiaries serving over 6.5 million people in 21 states,&quot; according to a research note by analysts Debra Cov and Gregg Urrill.</p>
<p>-- Earnings estimates are $1.30 per share for 1996, and $1.40 per share for 1997, they said.</p>
<p>-- 12-month target price is $23 per share.</p>
</text>
